motet-python-office Third-Party Notices
=======================================

This image is a curated base for document/PDF skill scripts. It contains no
Motet source code. It aggregates unmodified packages from Debian (bookworm),
PyPI, and npm; each component remains under its own license. Aggregation in
this image does not change any component's license.

Exact installed versions are recorded in this directory:

- DEBIAN_PACKAGES.txt  (dpkg package, version, source package)
- PYTHON_PACKAGES.txt  (pip freeze)
- NPM_PACKAGES.json    (npm ls under /opt/motet/npm)

