Corresponding source
--------------------

All Debian packages are installed unmodified from the Debian bookworm archive.
Corresponding source code for every Debian package in this image, at the exact
versions listed in DEBIAN_PACKAGES.txt, is available from Debian:

- https://snapshot.debian.org/ (archived by package name and version)
- `apt-get source <package>` against the Debian bookworm sources

Python and npm packages are installed unmodified from PyPI and the npm
registry at the versions listed in the manifests above; source is available
from those registries and the project URLs in each package's metadata.

Note on AGPL (Ghostscript)
--------------------------

Ghostscript is included as an unmodified standalone binary (`gs`) invoked as a
separate process by skill scripts. Its AGPL-3.0 terms apply to Ghostscript
itself; corresponding source is available as described above.
